{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Story ,</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A zombie outbreak starts at a subway station just as a train is about to leave. People run for their lives, trying to escape the chaos. Now, you must find out how the virus started and if there\u2019s a way to stop it. As you explore the dark tunnels and abandoned streets, danger lurks around every corner. Resources are limited, and every decision matters. Will you survive long enough to uncover the truth behind the virus's rapid spread?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-----</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669190/extras/f81a21b876718070b69840b88e2756ce.webp?t=1757576835\" width=758 height=3 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Face the nightmare head-on</strong> in a city overrun by the undead, where every corner hides danger and every shot counts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669190/extras/8f3ebb4f8e68ab0641c622ade60cfb49.poster.avif?t=1757576835\" width=1428 height=476 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669190/extras/8f3ebb4f8e68ab0641c622ade60cfb49.webm?t=1757576835\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669190/extras/8f3ebb4f8e68ab0641c622ade60cfb49.mp4?t=1757576835\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669190/extras/f81a21b876718070b69840b88e2756ce.webp?t=1757576835\" width=758 height=3 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Uncover the secrets of a forgotten outbreak</strong> through atmospheric exploration, cryptic notes, and eerie flashbacks that blur the line between reality and madness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669190/extras/dc8b5a25eb50b70dbbe2b9c0b629f334.poster.avif?t=1757576835\" width=1428 height=476 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669190/extras/dc8b5a25eb50b70dbbe2b9c0b629f334.webm?t=1757576835\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669190/extras/dc8b5a25eb50b70dbbe2b9c0b629f334.mp4?t=1757576835\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669190/extras/f81a21b876718070b69840b88e2756ce.webp?t=1757576835\" width=758 height=3 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Engage in intense third-person combat,</strong> seamlessly switching between firearms and brutal melee to survive overwhelming hordes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669190/extras/47fd80c74246da8fa0aeca6b980eb357.poster.avif?t=1757576835\" width=1052 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669190/extras/47fd80c74246da8fa0aeca6b980eb357.webm?t=1757576835\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669190/extras/47fd80c74246da8fa0aeca6b980eb357.mp4?t=1757576835\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669190/extras/f81a21b876718070b69840b88e2756ce.webp?t=1757576835\" width=758 height=3 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Solve environmental puzzles and unlock new areas,</strong> using wit and resourcefulness to stay one step ahead of the infected.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669190/extras/1a07dd291d75939b8753c819a74a7c5d.poster.avif?t=1757576835\" width=1082 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669190/extras/1a07dd291d75939b8753c819a74a7c5d.webm?t=1757576835\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669190/extras/1a07dd291d75939b8753c819a74a7c5d.mp4?t=1757576835\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669190/extras/f81a21b876718070b69840b88e2756ce.webp?t=1757576835\" width=758 height=3 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay features</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rich action and interaction design</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Puzzles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >inventory management</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Save Room and Item Storage</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All types of enemies from blood thirsty zombies, mutated fauna to other nightmare fuel creatures</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In game unlockable</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immersive OST inspired by the Classics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Detailed visual rendering</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple weapons and equipment system,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/imag